    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Going on holiday is usually an exciting event, so it may be surprising to learn that taking a plane might increase the risk of a silent killer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Let me "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Waiting for long periods in crowded airports, sitting in narrow plane seats, and flying for long hours can all contribute to the development of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "DVT",
            "zh": "深静脉血栓"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The longer people sit still without "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the more likely that "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "blood clots",
            "zh": "血块"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " form in their legs. These dangerous clots can be "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "deadly",
            "ref": "v-deadly"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " if they reach the lungs or brain."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This disease is commonly known as “"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "economy class syndrome",
            "zh": "经济舱综合征"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "”. The term was "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the late 1980s. Some research says it’s more common in those seated towards the back of planes. One study in 2021 found that air travel "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " than eight hours increases the risk of developing DVT."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is not "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "limited",
            "ref": "v-limit"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to plane travel. Long periods of "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " during train, bus, or car rides are also linked to the syndrome. Some people die from DVT after earthquakes because they choose to sleep in cars."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Experts say it can happen to anyone, but those over 40 are most "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Obesity",
            "zh": "肥胖"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is also a risk factor, and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "caution",
            "ref": "v-caution"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is required. Symptoms include:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l1",
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "pain in your legs that worsens when you walk"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "gloss",
              "v": "swelling",
              "zh": "肿胀"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ", usually in one leg"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "skin on the "
            },
            {
              "t": "gloss",
              "v": "calf",
              "zh": "小腿肚"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " area that is warm when you touch it"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "These symptoms can also happen in the arms."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Remember, due to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " skies and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "frequent delays",
            "zh": "频繁延误"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", even a short flight can turn into a long trip. It’s better to be prepared. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", there are some things you can do to lower your risk. Cut down on your fast-food intake before travelling. Wear "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "loose",
            "ref": "v-loose"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", comfortable clothes and stay active during travel. When you are back home or at your destination, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " moving and stay active."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
